This is an independent, clean-room implementation of a node that interoperates
with the "Personal AI Router" (PAIR) LAN inference-clustering protocol.

It contains NO third-party source code. Only the interoperability contract of
the protocol (network service identifiers, message field names, wire framing and
cryptographic parameters required to inter[-]operate) has been reproduced, as is
necessary and customary for interoperable software. No proprietary binaries,
decompiler output, or copyrighted assets are included in this repository.

